    "petrolpark.ponder.centrifuge.text_1": "A Centrifuge can separate certain items and fluids",
    "petrolpark.ponder.centrifuge.text_2": "Pump fluids into the top or bottom",
    "petrolpark.ponder.centrifuge.text_3": "Denser fluids will be thrown to the outer chamber and can be extracted from the side",
    "petrolpark.ponder.centrifuge.text_4": "Lighter fluids and items will remain in the inner chamber and can be extracted from the top or bottom",
    "petrolpark.ponder.centrifuge.text_5": "Items can also be extracted from the side",
    "petrolpark.ponder.crushing_wheel_filtering.header": "Filtering Crushing Wheel Recipes",
    "petrolpark.ponder.crushing_wheel_filtering.text_1": "Right-Click with Brass Casing between two Crushing Wheels to encase them",
    "petrolpark.ponder.crushing_wheel_filtering.text_2": "Now if there are conflicting recipes, the Crushing Wheel will pick them randomly rather than always choosing one",
    "petrolpark.ponder.crushing_wheel_filtering.text_3": "The filter slot can be used to always pick one recipe",
    "petrolpark.ponder.crushing_wheel_filtering.text_4": "Right-Click with a Wrench to remove the Casing",
    "petrolpark.ponder.boiling.header": "Boiling in the Mesh Basin",
    "petrolpark.ponder.boiling.text_1": "The Mesh Basin can be used on its own to boil or deep fry items",
    "petrolpark.ponder.boiling.text_2": "It will never start if there is another operator present",
    "petrolpark.ponder.drying.header": "Drying out items on the Drying Rack",
    "petrolpark.ponder.drying.text_1": "Right-Click to hang certain items on the Drying Rack",
    "petrolpark.ponder.drying.text_2": "After a while, you can remove the Item by Right-Clicking again",
    "petrolpark.ponder.drying.text_3": "This can be automated",
    "petrolpark.ponder.drying_chain_conveyor.header": "Drying out items on Chain Conveyors",
    "petrolpark.ponder.drying_chain_conveyor.text_1": "Certain items will dry if hung on a Chain Conveyor",
    "petrolpark.ponder.drying_chain_conveyor.text_2": "You can automate adding and removing the items with a Mechanical Arm",
    "petrolpark.ponder.extrusion_die.header": "Extruding blocks with the Extrusion Die",
    "petrolpark.ponder.extrusion_die.text_1": "The Extrusion Die can transform some blocks when they are pushed through it",
    "petrolpark.ponder.extrusion_die.text_2": "The Extrusion Die must remain static",
    "petrolpark.ponder.filtering.header": "Filtering out Fluids with the Spout and Mesh Basin",
    "petrolpark.ponder.filtering.text_1": "Spouting fluids through the mesh in a Mesh Basin can filter out particles",
    "petrolpark.ponder.filtering.text_2": "Some recipes may require the heat of a Blaze Burner",
    "petrolpark.ponder.filtering.text_3": "The filter slot can be used in case two recipes are conflicting",
    "petrolpark.ponder.horse_mill.header": "Generating Rotational Force using Horse Mills",
    "petrolpark.ponder.horse_mill.text_1": "Hook a mob into a Harness with a Lead",
    "petrolpark.ponder.horse_mill.text_2": "Super Glue Harnesses to a Horse Mill Bearing to make a Horse Mill",
    "petrolpark.ponder.horse_mill.text_3": "All the Harnesses must be facing the same direction",
    "petrolpark.ponder.horse_mill.text_4": "Right-Click the Horse Mill Bearing for it to start generating Rotational Force",
    "petrolpark.ponder.horse_mill.text_5": "The mobs must have a floor to walk on, or the Contraption will stall",
    "petrolpark.ponder.horse_mill.text_6": "Each mob provides a certain amount of Stress Capacity",
    "petrolpark.ponder.horse_mill.text_7": "The speed of the Horse Mill is limited by the slowest mob, and how far it is from the Bearing",
    "petrolpark.ponder.horse_mill.text_8": "Horses, Donkeys, Mules, Cows and Mooshrooms and potentially other modded mobs can operate a Horse Mill",
    "petrolpark.ponder.horse_mill.text_9": "Horses specifically can be selectively bred to increase their speed and the Stress Capacity they provide",
    "petrolpark.ponder.juicing.header": "Juicing items with the Mechanical Press and Mesh Basin",
    "petrolpark.ponder.juicing.text_1": "Pressing items held in a Mesh Basin will squeeze out any fluids, \"juicing\" them",
    "petrolpark.ponder.juicing.text_2": "Some recipes may require the heat of a Blaze Burner",
    "petrolpark.ponder.juicing.text_3": "The filter slot can be used in case two recipes are conflicting",
    "petrolpark.ponder.mechanical_arm_chain_conveyor.header": "Putting Items on Chains Conveyors with Mechanical Arms",
    "petrolpark.ponder.mechanical_arm_chain_conveyor.text_1": "Right-Click a Chain with a Mechanical Arm to add it as an in- or output",
    "petrolpark.ponder.mechanical_arm_chain_conveyor.text_2": "If the Arm does not have enough Rotational Input speed, it may miss items",
    "petrolpark.ponder.mechanical_arm_chain_conveyor.text_3": "Arms will pick up any Package they can, no matter what address...",
    "petrolpark.ponder.mechanical_arm_chain_conveyor.text_4": "...which means Packages will be redirected towards Arms, even if they can't pick them up",
    "petrolpark.ponder.recipe_book.header": "Unlocking Recipes with the Recipe Book",
    "petrolpark.ponder.recipe_book.text_1": "Certain Recipes are not possible without a Recipe Book containing the Recipe",
    "petrolpark.ponder.recipe_book.text_2": "Place a Chiseled Bookshelf next to the crafting block",
    "petrolpark.ponder.recipe_book.text_3": "Put the Recipe Book in the Chiseled Bookshelf",
    "petrolpark.ponder.recipe_book.text_4": "The Recipe is now possible",
    "petrolpark.ponder.recipe_book.text_5": "Recipe Books may be needed for a variety of Recipe types",
    "petrolpark.ponder.recipe_book_create.header": "Create Recipes Locked by Books",
    "petrolpark.ponder.recipe_book_create.text_1": "Some Recipes done in Create machines may require a Recipe Book",
    "petrolpark.ponder.recipe_book_create.text_2": "You have options of where to place the Chiseled Bookshelf",
    "petrolpark.ponder.redstone_programmer.header": "Using the Redstone Programmer",
    "petrolpark.ponder.redstone_programmer.text_1": "Click on a Redstone Link with a Redstone Programmer to add that channel to the Programmer",
    "petrolpark.ponder.redstone_programmer.text_2": "With JEI installed, you can also drag in items manually in the GUI",
    "petrolpark.ponder.redstone_programmer.text_3": "Shift-click to place the Programmer in the world",
    "petrolpark.ponder.redstone_programmer.text_4": "While placed or in a Player's inventory, Programmers can broadcast sequences of wireless Redstone signals",

